AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> "mold"@en-us)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> "mould"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> "A device consisting of a hollowed-out cavity that shapes fluid or plastic material into a specific form through the process of solidification or cooling."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000075> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602>)

