AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000501> "1D is a data item representing a one-dimensional structure or model representing a single linear dimension, often used in material science simulations or analysis."@en)
