AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000502> "A two-dimensional data item is a representation or analysis, commonly applied in studying planar material properties or surface phenomena."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000502> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000502> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> (OBSOLETE ASTM grainsize)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "TODO: axiom needs refinement"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "ASTM-Korngröße"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "OBSOLETE ASTM grainsize"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "Die ASTM-Korngröße ist eine Qualität, die durch ein Verfahren gemessen wird, das dem ASTM-Standard folgt."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "The ASTM grain size is a quality that is measured through a process that follows the ASTM standard."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000503> "true"^^xsd:boolean)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> (generation of magnetic field)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "Erzeugung eines Magnetfeldes"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "generation of magnetic field"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "is a process that occurs as a reaction to change of elctric field or movement of charges and produces a magnetic field"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> "ist ein Prozess, der als Reaktion auf eine Änderung des elektrischen Feldes oder die Bewegung von Ladungen abläuft und ein magnetisches Feld erzeugt"@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000521> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> (mechanical process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "mechanical process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "mechanischer Prozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "is a process in which forces, moments, or imposed displacements to objects or object aggregates occur and/or the equivalent (stresses, strains) to materials or portions of matter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> "ist ein Prozess, bei dem Kräfte, Momente oder auferlegte Verschiebungen auf Objekte oder Objektaggregate und/oder das Äquivalent (Spannungen, Dehnungen) auf Materialien oder Teile der Materie auftreten"@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000522> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)

