# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> (Defektdichte)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "Defektdichte"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "defect density"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "an intensive quality describing the number of defects per unit volume or area in a material, which can affect its mechanical and electronic properties"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "eine intensive Qualität, die die Anzahl der Defekte pro Volumen- oder Flächeneinheit in einem Material beschreibt, die sich auf seine mechanischen und elektronischen Eigenschaften auswirken können"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000595> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000596> (deformation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000596> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000596> "According to the modelling pattern we use TQCs to represent the participants properties before and after the process"@en)
