# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> (Dielektrizitätskonstante)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> "Dielektrizitätskonstante"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> "dielectric constant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> "Die Dielektrizitätskonstante ist eine elektrische Eigenschaft, die ein Maß für die Fähigkeit eines Materials darstellt, elektrische Energie in einem elektrischen Feld zu speichern."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> "The dielectric constant is an electrical property representing a measure of a material's ability to store electrical energy in an electric field."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000604> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019>)
