AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> "A proportion is a relational quality between two entities (the whole and the part) which quantifies the relation between the whole and its part."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000001>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> (mass ratio)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'mass ratio' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'material composition'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "Massenverhältnis"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "mass ratio"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "Das Massenverhältnis bezeichnet eine relationale Qualität, die einen Massenwert im Verhältnis zu einem anderen ausdrückt und typischerweise eine dimensionslose Zahl ergibt"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "Mass ratio denotes a relational quality expressing one mass value relative to another, typically producing a dimensionless number"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "A fiber-reinforced composite has a fiber-to-matrix mass ratio of 60:40"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> (Molverhältnis)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "Molverhältnis"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "molar ratio"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "molar proportion"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "Der Molanteil ist der Anteil, der die Anzahl der Einheiten des Teils im Verhältnis zur Anzahl der Einheiten des Ganzen quantifiziert."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "Molar proportion is the proportion which quantifies the entities count of the part in relation to the entities count of the whole."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "The molar ratio of hydrogen gas H2 molecules to water H2O molecules is 1/1 in the oxyhydrogen reaction. The molar ratio of oxygen molecules O2 to water molecules is 2/1.
The molar ratio of carbon dioxide to average atmosphere air is 420 ppm as of 2022 AD."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020103> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> (volume ratio)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'volume ratio' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'material composition'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "Volumenverhältnis"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "volume ratio"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "Volume ratio represents a relational quality expressing one volume value relative to another, typically resulting in a dimensionless number"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "Volumenverhältnis stellt eine relationale Qualität dar, die einen Volumenwert im Verhältnis zu einem anderen ausdrückt, typischerweise resultierend in einer dimensionslosen Zahl"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "A foam material has a pore-to-solid volume ratio of 4:1, indicating 80 % porosity"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020104> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080069>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> (polycrystal)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> "polycrystal"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> "Polycrystalline structure"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> "A polycrystal is a connected material entity aggregate that consists of multiple crystal grains joined through crystallographic interfaces."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000890>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020106> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000663>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> (OBSOLETE grain size distribution)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0100001> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000225>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> "Korngrößenverteilung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> "OBSOLETE grain size distribution"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> "An intensive quality describing the lower length scale object aggregate (grains) that is part of the material."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> "Eine intensive Qualität, die das Objektaggregat (Körner) auf niedrigerer Längenskala beschreibt, das Teil des Materials ist."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020112> "true"^^xsd:boolean)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> (fluid (object))

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> "fluid (object)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> "Fluid (object) is an object that consists of some portion of matter which bears an aggregate state that concretizes a liquid or gaseous aggregate state."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030> ObjectUnionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020289> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020290>)))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020113> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> (thermodynamic system)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> "thermodynamic system"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> "A thermodynamic system is a material entity whose parts are bearer of thermodynamic properties. A thermodynamic system environs a thermodynamic process by which the thermodynamic properties of the objects of the thermodynamic system change over time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020313>)))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020128> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020313>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> (spatial extend)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "spatial extend"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "Dimension quality is a quality of a material entity that pertains to its measurable spatial extent, such as length, area, or volume"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "the wall thickness of a steel pipe is a dimension quality functionally related to its pressure resistance"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020132> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000080> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000024> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000029> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000140>))))

