# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> (Zusammensetzung)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "There's a dfference between composition and chemical compositon for the following reason: chemical compositon is relevant when the mass/volume/mole proportions of chemical elements(!) are identified, whlist composition includes proportions of molecules, other pure chemical substances, or even proptions of objects (in an object aggregate)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "Zusammensetzung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "composition"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "Composition is an intensive quality which defines types and proportions of compounds present in a material entity and is subject of some composition data item."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "Zusammensetzung ist eine intensive Qualität, die Arten und Anteile von Verbindungen definiert, die in einer materiellen Einheit vorhanden sind, und Gegenstand einiger Zusammensetzungsdatenelemente ist."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "4 vol.% nitric acid solution, Styrene-Butadiene-Styrene (SBS) Block Copolymer with 50 vol.% of both styrene and butadiene"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000064> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> "Composition is a collective property of a portion of matter, i.e., the triple portion of matter has quality composition holds. As \"has quality\" is an inverse  functional property, only one instance of portion of matter can have this specific composition. However, proportions describe the relation between the prortion of matter (the whole) and some compound (the part). Thus, the following triples hold: portion of matter has relational quality proportion; portion of matter has part some substance (or whatever is your part); substance has relational quality proportion. \"Has relational quality\" is not inverse functional, i.e., it can point to a single object from 2 distinct subjects."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020335>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023004>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025001> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000080> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001>))))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> (chemical composition data item)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> "Datenelement zur chemischen Zusammensetzung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> "chemical composition data item"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> "chemical composition specification"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> "Bei einem Datenelement zur chemischen Zusammensetzung handelt es sich um eine Informationsinhaltseinheit, die sich auf die Zusammensetzung eines Stoffteils bezieht. Es verfügt über Bruchwertspezifikationen für Mitglieder, die Werte für Anteile von Anteilen (reiner) chemischer Elemente angeben, die Teile des Anteils der Materie sind."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> "Chemical composition data item is an information content entity that is about composition of a portion of matter. It has members fraction value specifications which specifiy values of propotions of portions of (pure) chemical elements, which are parts of the portion of matter."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> "Steel has quality chemical composition , and the chemical composition data item is about the chemical composition .The chemical composition data item has members fraction specifications of iron and carbon. These fraction specifications specify value of portion of iron and portion of carbon respectively. Furthermore, these fraction specifications specify  values of relational qualities (mass) proportion of iron and (mass) proportion of carbon."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025002> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020004> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000136> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002351> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025997>)))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025005> (3D)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025005> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025005> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025005> "3D"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025005> "A three-dimensional data item is a representation or analysis, commonly applied in studying material properties in its volume or describing a dependency of one variable on two other variables."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025005> "Orientation distribution function (ODF), potential energy landscape"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025005> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025007> (frequency)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025007> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025007> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025007> "frequency"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025007> "Frequency is a process attribute which characterizes the rate per second of oscillation or vibration."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025007> "Frequency of electromagnetic wave, Frequency of sound wave."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025007> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> (Transmissionselektronenmikroskop)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> "Transmissionselektronenmikroskop"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> "transmission electron microscope"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> "An electron microscope that produces high-resolution images of a sample's internal structure by transmitting electrons through the sample."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> "Ein Elektronenmikroskop, das hochauflösende Bilder der inneren Struktur einer Probe erzeugt, indem es Elektronen durch die Probe strahlt."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> "TEM")
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025008> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000624>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> (materieller Reaktionsprozess)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> "material reacting process has always energy minimization as a driving force."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> "material reacting process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> "materieller Reaktionsprozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> "Ein materieller Reaktionsprozess ist ein Prozess, der in einem Teil der Materie aufgrund einiger seiner Dispositionen oder Verhaltenseigenschaften stattfindet, die in einem stimulierenden Prozess umgesetzt werden. Sowohl der materielle Reaktionsprozess als auch der stimulierende Prozess müssen stattfindende Teile eines geplanten Prozesses sein, wenn der geplante Prozess stattfindet."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> "Material reacting process is a process which occurs in a portion of matter due to some of its disposition or behavioral material property which has realization in some  stimulating process. Both the material reacting process and stimulating process must be occurent parts of a planned process, if the planned process takes place."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001028> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000005>))))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000066> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000001>))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025009> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001028> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000016> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000005>)))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> (heating)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> "Heizung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> "heating"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> "Erwärmung ist eine Temperaturänderung, die dem Temperaturanstieg im System oder Objekt entspricht."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> "Heating is a change of temperature which corresponds to the increase of temperature in the system or object."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> (cooling)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> "Kühlung"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> "cooling"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> "Cooling is a change of temperature which corresponds to the decrease of temperature in the system or object."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> "Kühlung ist eine Temperaturänderung, die einem Temperaturabfall im System oder Objekt entspricht."@de)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> (analytical calculation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> "analytical calculation"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> "Analytical calculation is a computing process which has value specification or measurement datum as a specified output. It applies a closed-form mathematical expression or formula to a set it specified inputs (value specifications) without requiring stochastic sampling, iterative numerical solving, or data-driven training."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025015> (portion of lanthanum)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025015> "'portion of pure chemical element' and 'has part' only CHEBI:33336"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025015> "portion of lanthanum"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025015> "A portion of lanthanum is a portion of pure element that has parts only chebi:lanthanum atom."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025015> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020140> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_33336>)))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025015> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020140>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025016> (Innendurchmesser)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025016> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025016> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025016> "Innendurchmesser"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025016> "inner diameter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025016> "Der Innendurchmesser ist die Länge einer geraden Linie von einer Innenfläche eines Objekts oder Raums zur anderen Seite seiner Innenfläche durch den Mittelpunkt eines Objekts oder Raums, wenn es eine Innen- und Außenfläche hat."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025016> "Inner diameter is a length of a straight line from one inner surface of an object or space to the other side of its inner surface through the center of an object or space when it has the inside and outside surface."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025016> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050051>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025017> (outer diameter)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025017> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025017> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025017> "Außendurchmesser"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025017> "outer diameter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025017> "Der Außendurchmesser ist die Länge einer geraden Linie von einer Außenfläche eines Objekts oder Raums zur anderen Seite seiner Außenfläche durch den Mittelpunkt eines Objekts oder Raums, wenn es eine Innen- und Außenfläche hat."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025017> "Outer diameter is a length of a straight line from one outer surface of an object or space to the other side of its outer surface through the center of an object or space when it has the inside and outside surface."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025017> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050051>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> (geometric relational quality)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> "geometric relational quality"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> "geometrische relationale Qualität"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> "Geometric relational quality is a relational quality describing the geometric relation between two or more independent continuants."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> "Geometrische Beziehungsqualität ist eine Beziehungsqualität, die die geometrische Beziehung zwischen zwei oder mehr unabhängigen Kontinuen beschreibt."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> "Elongation of a specimen after a tensile step, i.e., the specimen before and after the test. Angle between a rolling direction of a rolled material and the longitudinal side of a specimen."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025018> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000145>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> (rate)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> "Ideally, a temporally qualified continuant must be used as a participant in a process where the qualities of the participant changes.This temporally qualitified continuant has an instance of quality with one on value before the process and another instance of the same quality with another on value after the process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> "In the axiom, the instance of quality in \"refers to\" triple must be the same instance as in \"has quality\" triple."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> "rate"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> "process attribute which describes the change of some quality of some of the participants in a process over time"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025019> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectAllValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020127> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019>) ObjectAllValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025006> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000057> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000004> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000068>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000086> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019>)))))))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025020> (single fatigue testing process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025020> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025020> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025020> "single fatigue testing process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025020> "Mechanical property analyzing process that is an occurent part of a fatigue testing process (S-N testing process). A single fatigue testing process assesses how many cycles a material can withstand under the given loading."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025020> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025021> (Stanzmachine)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025021> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025021> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025021> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stamping_press")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025021> "Stanzmachine"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025021> "stamping press"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025021> "Eine Stanzmachine ist ein Werkzeug/Gerät zur Metallbearbeitung, das dazu dient, geschnittenes Metall durch Verformung mit einer Matrize zu formen."@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025021> "Stamping press is a metalworking device which is used to shape a cut metal by deforming it with a die."@en)
