# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> (Austenit)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> "Austenit"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> "OBSOLETE austenite"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> "face-centered cubic phase of iron or an iron-based alloy, stable above the eutectoid temperature and capable of dissolving significant amounts of carbon in solid solution"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> "flächenzentrierte kubische Phase aus Eisen oder einer Legierung auf Eisenbasis, die oberhalb der Eutektoidtemperatur stabil ist und in der Lage ist, erhebliche Mengen Kohlenstoff in fester Lösung aufzulösen"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020097> "true"^^xsd:boolean)

